=== v then e selects to the end of the word
ref:    visual.txt *v*
quote:  "Start Visual mode per character."
given:  |foo bar
keys:   ve
expect: [fo|o] bar
mode:   visual

=== a given selection, extended with w
ref:    visual.txt *v*
quote:  "Start Visual mode per character."
given:  [f|o]o bar
keys:   w
expect: [^foo |b]ar
mode:   visual
